seg-b061f6742a86 = a <b>persistent</b> signal-in-space error on every fix: relay errors do not average away over an arc of hours, so it is carried as constant position biases, one common to both vehicles (<c1/> of the variance, default { "0.9" }, ILLUSTRATIVE) and one independent per vehicle. A constant bias gives no averaging benefit, the conservative reading;

