seg-3513a55e44e5 = It reports the formal and Monte Carlo relative position and velocity error in the target's local axes, the fraction of epochs with fixes on both vehicles, the mean normalised estimation error squared (NEES) of the relative state against its expected value of { "6" }, the relative drift from ignoring the gravity harmonics, a closed-form Hill (Clohessy-Wiltshire) check for the circular case, the terminal relative-sensor models of the thread's <c1/> (ILLUSTRATIVE parameters) beside the signals-only figure, and the 6x6 covariance of the chaser at the end.

