seg-c2eae4508a2f = <b>AFS fix</b>: from the relays visible above a flat mask, with the ENU DOP cofactor times a user range error. <c1/> uses the signal-in-space error; <c2/> uses the correction-link residual of <c3/>. With exactly three relays in view the clock is aided, not estimated, and the fix then carries <c4/>: this is where lunar time enters the fix.

