seg-39c938fb24e9 = <b>Terrain-relative fix</b>: <c1/> runs the crate's TERCOM/SITAN matcher on its synthetic relief and an Earth metre scale (a stand-in, not south-polar relief); <c2/> takes the Cramer-Rao bound of matching an elevation window of the real LOLA DEM at the site, <c3/>, and claims no fix where the relief constrains one direction only (the aperture problem).

