seg-795ef82edc61 = <b>Lunar time</b>: the clock error at the fix combines the entry clock, its growth since synchronisation and the LTC-TT term of <c1/>. With <c2/> the vehicle ticks TT and the accumulated offset is an uncorrected bias; with <c3/> only the uncertainty of the published { "56" } to { "59" } microseconds per day band over the horizon remains. A time-tag error moves a fix along track by <c4/>.

